  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(15 fotos) La oficina de Caja Rural Onda en la Cooperativa, en la esquina de Ingeniero Echegaray con Ceramista Al&oacute;s, acoge desde esta semana pasada la novena exposici&oacute;n de artistas. En esta ocasi&oacute;n, se trata de la muestra de pinturas de Albert Solsona.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/P1640583.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">&quot;Desde la Caja Rural de Onda demostramos una vez m&aacute;s nuestro apoyo a la cultura local&quot;, ha indicado la directora de la oficina, Susana Zamora Feliu (que aparece en las dos primeras fotos de abajo junto a la artista)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">La idea es que, a</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">provechando la amplitud del espacio, se vayan sucediendo muestras de artistas ondenses cada cierto tiempo y ya han expuesto su obra Mari Carmen Vidal Casta&ntilde;, Mcarmen G. Carrasco, Rosana Mora Corella, Ximo Safont, Ruth Diago, Irene Molina,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Mar&iacute;a Rosario Badenes y&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Sandra Vega Marz&aacute;.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640556.jpg\" alt=\"p1640556\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640558.jpg\" alt=\"p1640558\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640560.jpg\" alt=\"p1640560\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640562.jpg\" alt=\"p1640562\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640564.jpg\" alt=\"p1640564\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640567.jpg\" alt=\"p1640567\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640569.jpg\" alt=\"p1640569\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640571.jpg\" alt=\"p1640571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640573.jpg\" alt=\"p1640573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640575.jpg\" alt=\"p1640575\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640577.jpg\" alt=\"p1640577\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640578.jpg\" alt=\"p1640578\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640579.jpg\" alt=\"p1640579\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640582.jpg\" alt=\"p1640582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expoalbertsolcaixaruralondacooperativa/p1640583.jpg\" alt=\"p1640583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
